"seek": 14650, "start": 166.7, "end": 172.5, "text": " And when they rejected it, President Trump obliterated the Iranian nuclear sites this summer.", "tokens": [51375, 400, 562, 436, 15749, 309, 11, 3117, 3899, 23740, 1681, 770, 264, 24934, 8179, 7533, 341, 4266, 13, 51665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.11360166239184002, "compression_ratio": 1.6150793650793651, "no_speech_prob": 2.3852751371289393e-12}, {"id": 46, "seek": 17250, "start": 172.5, "end": 179.5, "text": " Now, the president said in the lead-up to tonight that we can do this the easy way or they can do it the hard way.", "tokens": [50365, 823, 11, 264, 3868, 848, 294, 264, 1477, 12, 1010, 281, 4440, 300, 321, 393, 360, 341, 264, 1858, 636, 420, 436, 393, 360, 309, 264, 1152, 636, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08915497985067247, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 3.40508849415444e-12}, {"id": 47, "seek": 17250, "start": 179.5, "end": 187.5, "text": " He warned in no uncertain terms, Hamas, that if they did not take the deal, he used the word, they would be obliterated.", "tokens": [50715, 634, 21284, 294, 572, 11308, 2115, 11, 8234, 296, 11, 300, 498, 436, 630, 406, 747, 264, 2028, 11, 415, 1143, 264, 1349, 11, 436, 576, 312, 23740, 1681, 770, 13, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08915497985067247, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 3.40508849415444e-12}, {"id": 48, "seek": 17250, "start": 187.5, "end": 190.1, "text": " Does anyone doubt that would have been the next step?", "tokens": [51115, 4402, 2878, 6385, 300, 576, 362, 668, 264, 958, 1823, 30, 51245], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.08915497985067247, "compression_ratio": 1.5454545454545454, "no_speech_prob": 3.40508849415444e-12}, {"id": 49, "seek": 19010, "start": 190.1, "end": 197.1, "text": " According to a report from our very own Jennifer Griffin, all 20 living hostages will be freed on the same day.", "tokens": [50365, 7328, 281, 257, 2275, 490, 527, 588, 1065, 14351, 39188, 11, 439, 945, 2647, 3975, 1660, 486, 312, 21796, 322, 264, 912, 786, 13, 50715], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07065925718862799, "compression_ratio": 1.5336538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 2.6232666212877565e-12}, {"id": 50, "seek": 19010, "start": 197.1, "end": 204.1, "text": " There will be no ceremonies inside of Gaza to humiliate the hostages before they are handed over.", "tokens": [50715, 821, 486, 312, 572, 36176, 1854, 295, 37800, 281, 29981, 473, 264, 3975, 1660, 949, 436, 366, 16013, 670, 13, 51065], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07065925718862799, "compression_ratio": 1.5336538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 2.6232666212877565e-12}, {"id": 51, "seek": 19010, "start": 204.1, "end": 210.1, "text": " Hours ago, here is how the president learned of the news during a press conference about Antifa.", "tokens": [51065, 389, 5067, 2057, 11, 510, 307, 577, 264, 3868, 3264, 295, 264, 2583, 1830, 257, 1886, 7586, 466, 5130, 29634, 13, 51365], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07065925718862799, "compression_ratio": 1.5336538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 2.6232666212877565e-12}, {"id": 52, "seek": 19010, "start": 210.1, "end": 211.1, "text": " Take a look.", "tokens": [51365, 3664, 257, 574, 13, 51415], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.07065925718862799, "compression_ratio": 1.5336538461538463, "no_speech_prob": 2.6232666212877565e-12}, {"id": 53, "seek": 21110, "start": 211.1, "end": 214.1, "text": " Well, they're smart, but they're not smart enough.", "tokens": [50365, 1042, 11, 436, 434, 4069, 11, 457, 436, 434, 406, 4069, 1547, 13, 50515], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 54, "seek": 21110, "start": 214.1, "end": 215.1, "text": " They...", "tokens": [50515, 814, 485, 50565], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 55, "seek": 21110, "start": 215.1, "end": 217.1, "text": " Oh, my microphone's broken.", "tokens": [50565, 876, 11, 452, 10952, 311, 5463, 13, 50665], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 56, "seek": 21110, "start": 217.1, "end": 220.1, "text": " ...departments to find the criminal conspiracy.", "tokens": [50665, 1097, 19929, 446, 1117, 281, 915, 264, 8628, 20439, 13, 50815], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 57, "seek": 21110, "start": 220.1, "end": 221.1, "text": " Okay.", "tokens": [50815, 1033, 13, 50865], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 58, "seek": 21110, "start": 221.1, "end": 222.1, "text": " Thank you.", "tokens": [50865, 1044, 291, 13, 50915], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 59, "seek": 21110, "start": 222.1, "end": 224.1, "text": " I'm just giving...", "tokens": [50915, 286, 478, 445, 2902, 485, 51015], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 60, "seek": 21110, "start": 224.1, "end": 226.1, "text": " Mr. President!", "tokens": [51015, 2221, 13, 3117, 0, 51115], "temperature": 0.0, "avg_logprob": -0.21341592362783487, "compression_ratio": 1.4870689655172413, "no_speech_prob": 5.3882241550506915e-12}, {"id": 61, "seek": 21110, "start": 226.1, "end": 235.1, "text": " Yeah, I was just given a note by the Secretary of State saying that we're very close to a deal in the Middle East, and they're going to need me pretty quickly.", "tokens": [51115, 865, 11, 286, 390, 445, 2212, 257, 3637, 